    },
    "body": "**Problem:** The mempool estimator added in #34075 persists mined-block stats for restart.\r\nShutdown saves and unregisters the estimator before draining queued validation callbacks.\r\nA queued block update can leave the saved stats behind the active chain tip, so the reader ignores the file on restart.\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Save and unregister the estimator after the existing callback drain, which already follows the chainstate flush.",
